            "research": "Adaptive physical intelligence for dexterous manipulation across scales",
            "description": "Dandan is an Assistant Professor in the Department of Bioengineering at Imperial College London and founder of the Multi-Scale Embodied Intelligence Lab. Her research connects tactile sensing, robot learning, shared autonomy and optical and magnetic microrobotics.",
